# Monolith Tasks - AI Rules v5.0

## Architecture
- Feature-First structure
- Clean Architecture: domain -> data -> presentation
- UTC dates in DB, .toLocal() in UI only
- Pure Dart in core/utils (no Flutter dependencies)

## Tech Stack
- Flutter 3.19+, Dart 3.3+
- flutter_bloc + equatable
- Drift (single API, @DataClassName on ALL tables)
- go_router v14+ (state.pathParameters, NOT pathParams)
- get_it ONLY (manual, NO injectable annotations!)
- fpdart for Either<Failure, T>
- table_calendar (NOT syncfusion)
- flutter_local_notifications

## Forbidden
- @injectable, @LazySingleton, @lazySingleton (use manual get_it)
- while(true) in Streams
- File() without kIsWeb check
- state.pathParams
- freezed
- syncfusion_* or other paid packages
- print() (use logger)
- DateTime without .toUtc() in DB
- UUID in UI layer
- handleError with return in Stream (use transform)
- update().write() partial (use .replace())
- firstWhere with throw in Stream (use getSingleOrNull)

## Required
- @DataClassName on ALL tables (TaskRow, ProjectRow, HabitRow, ReminderRow)
- failures.dart with Failure base class
- ErrorView, LoadingView, EmptyState widgets
- All 4 DAOs (Task, Project, Habit, Reminder)
- AppLocalizations for ALL strings
- Minimum 1 unit test per UseCase
- Doc comments on public APIs
